flowchart TD
    S([Analyst uploads CSV]) --> V{Every row valid?}
    V -- No --> E[Return row-level errors<br/>nothing is saved]
    E --> X([End])
    V -- Yes --> P[Predict churn probability<br/>XGBoost, whole batch]
    P --> R[Classify risk<br/>Low / Medium / High]
    R --> ST[(Save or update customers)]
    ST --> EX[Explain each customer<br/>SHAP contributions]
    EX --> NBA[Next Best Action<br/>what-if re-scoring + plan]
    NBA --> Q{Medium or High risk?}
    Q -- Yes --> PA[(Create Pending follow-up<br/>or refresh suggestion)]
    Q -- No --> SK[No follow-up needed]
    PA --> D([Dashboard updated])
    SK --> D
